s, schools, sights and parks; schema 40): row 12 column 16 offices 65 / 780 is D4 160 / 1680 (number 238: 237 cells come before it by row and column; 219 before decision 91); column 19 shops 60 / 729 D4 320 / 1440 (241; 222 before); column 20 a park, D1 holding no one (242; homes 230 / 0 D3, 223, before); column 27 a factory 0 / 82, D1 0 / 96 (3072 / 32 jobs; 249; homes 41 / 0 D1, 230, before); row 1 column 2 is no longer land. Decision 91's table: factories no eighths homes, schools and public offices and sights 1, farms 2, a park nothing. The town's 469 buildings: 123 D1, 189 D2, 130 D3, 27 D4, no existing stock (437: 88, 188, 134, 27 before). All values worked out by hand and checked with an independent Python implementation (tools/golden-checks/city_buildings.py).",
